{"created": "2020-09-11T18:50:58.457919+00:00", "modified": "2022-06-03T15:18:15.132280+00:00", "id": 4025120, "conceptrecid": "4025119", "doi": "10.5061/dryad.s7h44j150", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5061/dryad.s7h44j150", "metadata": {"title": "Three dimensional dataset combining gait and full body movement of children with autism spectrum disorders collected by Kinect v2 camera", "doi": "10.5061/dryad.s7h44j150", "publication_date": "2020-09-14", "description": "<p><span>To the best of our knowledge, this is the maiden attempt to build a three-dimensional dataset that combines gait and body movement analysis of children with Autism Spectrum Disorders (ASD) in controlled environments for fifty children with autism children and fifty typical children. A 3D dataset includes 3D joints positions, the corresponding skeleton movement video, joints trajectories video captured by Kinect v2, and color videos captured by Samsung Note 9 rear camera. On the other hand, color videos for 9 children suffer from severe autism is also included for scientific benefit. Finally, the dataset includes 700 folders (350 for typical children, 350 for children with ASD) which include 3D files of tracked joints, angles between joints, and skeleton tracking video related to the augmentation of the original dataset based on seven transformations described in the paper.</span></p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "A. \u0650Al-Jubouri, Ahmed", "affiliation": "University of Babylon*", "orcid": "0000-0003-3768-9617"}, {"name": "Hadi, Israa", "affiliation": "University of Babylon*"}, {"name": "Rajihy, Yasen", "affiliation": "University of Babylon*"}], "keywords": ["autism spectrum disorders", "Kinect v2", "Gait analysis", "body movement analysis", "3D dataset", "Dataset augmentation"], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "https://ijact.in/index.php/ijact/article/view/1193", "relation": "isCitedBy", "scheme": "url"}], "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-zero"}, "communities": [{"id": "dryad"}], "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "4025119"}}]}}, "title": "Three dimensional dataset combining gait and full body movement of children with autism spectrum disorders collected by Kinect v2 camera", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4025120", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/4025120", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/4025120?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5061/dryad.s7h44j150", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5061/dryad.s7h44j150", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5061/dryad.s7h44j150", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4025120/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4025119", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/4025119", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:4025120/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:4025120/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4025120/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4025120/media-files", "archive": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4025120/files-archive", "archive_media": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4025120/media-files-archive", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4025120/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/4025120/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4025120/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4025120/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4025120/access/links", "access_grants": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4025120/access/grants", "access_users": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4025120/access/users", "access_request": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4025120/access/request", "access": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4025120/access", "communities": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4025120/communities", "communities-suggestions": "https://zenodo.org/ap